From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charlie <5764343+charlielye@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 13:27:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: consume wsdb from native-packages and add kvdb
 (aztec-packages #24392)

The foundation extracted wsdb/lmdblib/kvdb into native-packages/, decoupled
from barretenberg. The wsdb use-local portals move to native-packages/wsdb/ts,
and the kv-store NAPI addon (nodejs_module.node) now ships as
@aztec-foundation/kvdb rather than inside @aztec-foundation/bb.js --
@aztec/native locates it there.

diff --git a/labs-aztec-toolchain/pins.mjs b/labs-aztec-toolchain/pins.mjs
index eedfbfa621b4f00a1fca57e9cefeb7c74ebacf4c..a949edd98067d2db3d90ec56b1384dc14712884b 100755
